  "policy": {
    "pass_definition": "The exact requested scalar is present, its visible Taiwan Traditional topology agrees with the current CNS mapping and stroke-sequence structure, it remains directly recognizable at native, 128, 64, and 32 px cell sizes, the ink is isolated from the grid, and no stray thorn or topology-changing defect is visible.",
